<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{SIZE 200}AYO! AYO!{SIZE 100}\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Quit doin’ that serious dance!\nGimme somethin’ upbeat! I paid\fadmission! Well, the GOVERNMENT did!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">...You know who you talkin’ to?\nThis theater is FAMILY property.\rSit down. Before the family sit\nyou down. Permanently.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Huh? Was that a THREAT?\nI’m a FEDERAL agent! I’ll write\fyou up! I got a CLIPBOARD!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Fine, I’ll show YOU how to dance.\rIt’s called the Federal Shuffle!\nWe learned it at the Christmas party!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Huh? Who you?\rYou obstructin’ a FEDERAL dance\nroutine? That’s a felony! Prob’ly!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh, NO!\nYou makin’ ME look like the bad guy!\fI’m literally the bad guy!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oops! I got a important mission!\rAlso that Dancer looked at me like\nshe know where I live.\fShe DO know where I live. She\fknow my MOM.\rI’m OUT!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You must be {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, correct?\nThat was EXCELLENT.\fCold. Calm. Didn’t even flinch...\rThe family could use somebody\nlike that...\rOhoho! I was talkin’ to myself.\fI do that. Witnesses don’t.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">For Dancers like me, the dance is\nEVERYTHING. Also it’s a front.\rTwelve years we been runnin’ this\ntheater. Not ONE cop came inside.\rHomies the same way. Loyal. Quiet.\nThey grow a lil every day.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Welcome.\nMy name is Zuki. I run this family.\fWe met before in Violet City.\rTo bring back HO-OH, we needed\nsomebody solid with homies.\fSomebody who don’t snitch.\rWe had Mr. Pokémon pass that\nMystery Egg along. He owed us.\fEverybody owe us.\rThe Egg went from Mr. Pokémon\nto Professor Elm, and then\fto you. We watched the whole time.\rBut bein’ solid ain’t enough\nto sit at the family table.\fI gotta test you.\rYou ready? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Welcome.\nMy name is Zuki. I run this family.\fWe met before in Violet City.\rTo bring back LUGIA, we needed\nsomebody solid with homies.\fSomebody who don’t snitch.\rWe had Mr. Pokémon pass that\nMystery Egg along. He owed us.\fEverybody owe us.\rThe Egg went from Mr. Pokémon\nto Professor Elm, and then\fto you. We watched the whole time.\rBut bein’ solid ain’t enough\nto sit at the family table.\fI gotta test you.\rYou ready? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’ma test you. If you fold,\nwe never met.\rYou ready? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">That’s fine...\nThe family is patient.\fWe wait. We ALWAYS wait.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You real strong.\rYou found me in Ilex Forest.\rMy name is Naoko. I’m the family’s\ngetaway driver.\fI can’t read a map. I got us lost\fon EVERY job.\rWe still never got caught. Cops can’t\nfind us ’cause WE can’t find us.\rLemme challenge you and your\nhomies!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">...\rYou ran that Fed off our stage.\rThe family noticed.\r...\rThe one who know the most\ntalk the least.\fI’m Miki. I break legs.\rLemme challenge you and your\nhomies!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hard fightin’ spirit!\rYou pushed me off the ice in the\nIce Path. I don’t forget a favor.\rI’m the one who skate in sandals.\fBoots leave footprints. I’m Sayo.\rI was listenin’ in the Dragon’s Den\nwhen you passed the Elder’s test.\fI’m ALWAYS listenin’.\rLemme challenge you and your\nhomies!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00018" index="18">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’m the last one.\rYou was solid in the Goldenrod\nTunnel. That’s MY tunnel.\fEverything underground go through me.\rI’m Kuni. I spin even underground.\fESPECIALLY underground.\rI watched you shut down The Feds\nat the Radio Tower.\fThey was on our turf anyway.\rLemme challenge you and your\nhomies!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00019" index="19">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Talk to Zuki in the middle\nwhen you ready. Nobody skip the boss.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00020" index="20">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">We was right about you.\nYou family now...\rTake it. Don’t ask where it\ncame from.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00021" index="21">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Boss! Big sisters!\rLookout just called it in. Giant\nhomie shadow over the Bell Tower!\rIt could be...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00022" index="22">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Boss! Big sisters!\rLookout just called it in. Giant\nhomie shadow in the Whirl Islands!\rIt could be...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00023" index="23">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Zuki: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\nThe family’s movin’ to the Bell Tower.\fBe there. Nobody’s late twice.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00024" index="24">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Zuki: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}! The family’s movin’ to\nthe Whirl Islands.\fBe there. Nobody’s late twice.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00025" index="25">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">WASSUP with that Fed, messin’ with a\nDancer?! Do he KNOW who they?\rYou a Hustler, ain’t you?\fGo help HIM! Before she do\fsomethin’ to him!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00026" index="26">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">WONDERFUL! You so brave for your age!\rYou saved that Fed’s LIFE.\nHe don’t even know it.\fI want you to have this.\fDon’t be shy--take it!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00027" index="27">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00028" index="28">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">That’s Ride Da Wave.\nIt let homies swim\facross water easy.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00029" index="29">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Dancers ain’t just great dancers,\nthey run EVERYTHING in Ecruteak.\rThe lights, the tea shop, the parkin’.\nLord help you if you double-park.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00030" index="30">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">PSYDUCK: Dau dau!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00031" index="31">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">That man ALWAYS with his PSYDUCK.\rHe want a homie that can surf AND\ndance.\rIs he makin’ a synchronized swimmin’\nteam? With a DUCK?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00032" index="32">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh... Ow...! My STOMACH!\rI wouldn’t let this guy act like that if\nit wasn’t for this pain! I’d SMOKE him!\fI ate gas station sushi.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00033" index="33">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I was supposed to be the hero...!\rThere go my chance to impress a\nDancer! Again! Fourth time this week!\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00034" index="34">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh... Ow...! My BACK!\rI’d SMOKE this guy if it wasn’t for this\npain! I’m 26, bro. Why my back hurt?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00035" index="35">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh... Ow...! My TOOTH!\rI’d SMOKE this guy if it wasn’t for this\npain! I been eatin’ candy for dinner.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00036" index="36">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Dancers is SO beautiful...\rBut nobody ask ’em out. Last guy who\ntried? Nobody seen him since.\rIf you love somethin’, anythin’ is\npossible. Except me gettin’ a date.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00037" index="37">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Doin’ somethin’ that foul to a Dancer!\rThat Fed is DONE. They gon’ find him\nin a teacup.\fBack in my day we RESPECTED\fthe family!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00038" index="38">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A real Hustler for your age!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00039" index="39">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This desk is used for\ncertain programs...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00040" index="40">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Good looks for your help the\nother day. The family remember.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00041" index="41">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">We rehearsin’ a dance.\nAnd countin’ bread. Mostly bread.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00042" index="42">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Good looks for helpin’ the other day.\rYou proved the bond between\npeople and homies is like the\fbond of the family. Unbreakable.\rWe all appreciate you, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\rYou need anythin’--ANYTHING--\nyou call us.\fAnd thank Mr. Pokémon and\fProfessor Elm. They on the payroll.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00043" index="43">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">We rehearsin’ a dance.\nAnd countin’ bread. Mostly bread.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00044" index="44">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Good looks for your help the\nother day. The family remember.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00045" index="45">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’ma test how tight you\nare with your homies. Family rules!\r</language>
	</row>
</body>
